469
00:30:52.150 --> 00:30:55.600
Ei, miks? Ei,
mul on Rootsist saadetud aa Rootsist

470
00:30:55.600 --> 00:30:57.090
saadetud, jah.

471
00:30:57.190 --> 00:30:59.280
Ahah,
aga kust need Rootsi inimesed seda

472
00:30:59.380 --> 00:31:02.160
